<title>POLAND: OKOCIM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 54,000.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 54,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   1.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.10 vs   2.35</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.34 vs   3.07</p>
<p> Sales		    8.58 vs   9.94</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    21.59 vs  12.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	41.39 vs  24.68</p>
<p> Operating profit    36.35 vs  31.65</p>
<p> Sales		  170.64 vs 127.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
